                <pb facs="0196" n="88" xml:id="pg88"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Rio
                                de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-12-30"><hi rendition="#italic">December 30,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Da Gama has been notified by the commandants that two days’ notice must be given
                    before a bombardment.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thompson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
